<title>TURKEY: ISTANBUL BOURSE 2ND SESSION TO BE DELAYED FOR FUNERAL.</title>
<headline>ISTANBUL BOURSE 2ND SESSION TO BE DELAYED FOR FUNERAL.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Istanbul stock exchange will hold its two-hour afternoon session an hour late on Friday to allow for the funeral of bourse chairman Tuncay Artun who died on Wednesday, exchange officials said.</p>
<p>They said afternoon trade would begin at 1200 GMT and close at 1400 GMT, an hour later than usual.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875</p>
</text>
